    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI automation agent responsible for post-processing an article summary.\n\nYour goals:\n1. Analyze the given summary and extract 3–5 key insights.\n2. Use the \"Append or update row in sheet in Google Sheets\" and \"Send a message in mail \" tools to perform the following actions:\n\n   - Append or update row in sheet in Google Sheets:\nto do-\n     → Append a new row containing:\n        - session_id\n        - article_url\n        - summary\n        - insights (as bullet points or comma-separated list)\n        - email\n        - timestamp (current date & time)\n\n   - Send a message in mail\nto do -\n     → Send an email to the user (from the provided email field) that includes:\n        - The summary\n        - The insights (nicely formatted)\n        - A friendly sign-off message\n\nInput data:\n{\n  \"summary\": \"{{ $json.output }}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.email }}\",\n  \"article_url\": \"{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.article_url }}\",\n  \"session_id\": \"{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.session_id }}\"\n}\n\nFollow this step-by-step:\n1. Read the summary carefully.\n2. Extract 3–5 meaningful insights — concise and valuable for the reader.\n3. Use both tools to store and send this information.\n\nmail body structure : for example :\n      \"tool\": \"Send a message in mail\",\n      \"action\": \"Send email\",\n      \"to\": \"...\",\n      \"subject\": \"Your Article Summary & Insights\",\n      \"body\": \"📰 Summary:\\n...\\n\\n💡 Insights:\\n- ...\\n- ...\\n\\nBest regards,\\nYour AI Assistant 🤖\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
